# ============================================================================
# StockPilot — Docker build context exclusions
#
# `.gitignore` has NO effect on `docker build`. The build context is copied into
# the daemon verbatim, and anything copied becomes an image layer: removing it in
# a later layer does not remove it from `docker history`.
#
# The rule that matters most here is **no `.env*` file may ever enter the
# context.** `backend/.env` holds the owner credentials and
# `backend/.env.runtime` holds the restricted runtime-role credential. Both are
# local-only and gitignored; neither may reach a build context, let alone an
# image. Production secrets are injected as environment variables at run time.
#
# Sources are deliberately KEPT (backend/src, frontend/src, database) — together
# they are about 2 MB, and keeping them leaves room for a future frontend image
# and a migration image to share this context.
# ============================================================================

# --- Git metadata -------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Dependencies: installed inside the image, never copied in ---------------
# This also guarantees the @node-rs/argon2 native binary is resolved for the
# image's platform rather than inherited from a developer's host OS.
**/node_modules
**/jspm_packages
**/web_modules
**/.yarn
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/pnpm-store

# --- Build output: rebuilt inside the image ------------------------------------
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Secrets and credentials (critical) ---------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials.json
**/secrets
**/secrets.*.json
**/*service-account*.json

# --- Logs and test output -----------------------------------------------------
**/logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/.vitest
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/.playwright
**/*.pid
**/*.seed

# --- Local database artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# Migrations are the one exception: they are committed source.
**/*.sql
!database/migrations/**/*.sql
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/pgdata
**/.pgdata

# --- Editor / IDE / OS --------------------------------------------------------
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.zed
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*.suo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.tmp
**/tmp
**/.temp

# --- Docker's own files -------------------------------------------------------
# Excluded so they can never be baked into an image; the builder reads them
# separately and does not need them in the context.
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml